      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Coruja. O relógio interno de Hoothoot é sempre preciso. Ele inclina a cabeça em um ritmo constante. Como consegue marcar as horas com exatidão, alguns países o consideram uma divindade da sabedoria, conhecedora dos caminhos do mundo.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Voador &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Hoothoot pode evoluir para Noctowl no nível 7 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Foresight, Growl, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Hypnosis</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Peck</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Confusion</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Defog, Echoed Voice</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Zen Headbutt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Psycho Shift</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Extrasensory</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Take Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Reflect</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Air Slash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Uproar</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Roost</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Moonblast</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Dream Eater, Synchronoise</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Aerial Ace, Agility, Air Cutter, Air Slash, Amnesia, Attract, Brave Bird, Calm Mind, Confide, Confuse Ray, Defog, Double Team, Dream Eater, Dual Wingbeat, Echoed Voice, Endure, Facade, Feather Dance, Fly, Frustration, Haze, Heat Wave, Hidden Power, Hurricane, Hyper Voice, Imprison, Magic Coat, Nasty Plot, Night Shade, Protect, Psybeam, Psych Up, Psychic, Rain Dance, Recycle, Reflect, Rest, Return, Roost, Round, Screech, Shadow Ball, Skill Swap, Sky Attack, Sleep Talk, Snore, Spite, Steel Wing, Stored Power, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Tailwind, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thief, Toxic, Uproar, Work Up, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Agility, Defog, Feather Dance, Feint Attack, Hurricane, Mean Look, Mirror Move, Night Shade, Sky Attack, Supersonic, Whirlwind, Wing Attack</p>",
